--
N5008 [temp.class.spec.mfunc]/1, [class.base.init]/1: the copy
constructors of two partial specializations (with and without a pack)
are defined out of line with a ctor-initializer.  On bin53 the
definition was attached without its mem-initializers, so the copies
were indeterminate.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept the program.
